<script lang="ts">import { onMount } from 'svelte'; import { api,type User } from '$lib/api'; let user=$state<User|null>(null), editing=$state(false), saved=$state(false); let phone=$state(''), qualification=$state('Bachelor’s Degree'), institution=$state(''), score=$state(''), course=$state('MCA'); onMount(async()=>user=await api('/auth/me'));</script>
